.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/791dd83000ead57b8d4980ddfe4ed51b.poster.avif?t=1787611659\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/791dd83000ead57b8d4980ddfe4ed51b.webm?t=1787611659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/791dd83000ead57b8d4980ddfe4ed51b.mp4?t=1787611659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/03b434fb245b07533ed5a1bbc21e6120.avif?t=1787611659\" width=1170 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Resource Management:</strong> Craft and manage the resources required for shelter upkeep. You must repair failures and maintain control over your environment before the space collapses around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/3c4037bc114b193afa2153ef1aa6e1b9.poster.avif?t=1787611659\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/3c4037bc114b193afa2153ef1aa6e1b9.webm?t=1787611659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091530/extras/3c4037bc114b193afa2153ef1aa6e1b9.mp4?t=1787611659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\"